  "description": "Haejin succeeds a weird book after father's death who was a tomb robber. Uninterpretable pattern was on the mysterious book. Cause of creepy feeling, Heajin burnt the book away. On that night, Haejin suffered from a nightmare and when he woke up he felt that he could feel a special ability was given. Haejin could see stories of relics if he spells a chant. As Haejin's ability of relic appraising develops, a beautiful Gallary owner Eunhae, offered a job in her gallery...  \n(From KENAZ's website)\n\n**Original Webtoon (Expired):**  \n[Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H035149402), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54516216), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5086338), [Bufftoon](https://bufftoon.plaync.com/series/1006320), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/5930), Tocsoda\n\n**Official Translations: **  \nFrench",
